        implementation: [
          "Place RDS in private database subnets and restrict access to application security groups.",
          "Enable encryption at rest and enforce TLS where supported.",
          "Use Secrets Manager or another approved secret delivery method instead of embedding credentials.",
          "Configure S3 Block Public Access and narrowly scoped bucket policies.",
          "Define backup retention and test point-in-time restore procedures."
