          "Separate deployment permissions from runtime application permissions.",
          "Use resource-level permissions and conditions where supported.",
          "Require encrypted transport and encrypted storage for sensitive data.",
          "Enable audit logging and protect log retention from unauthorized modification."
        ],
        productionConsiderations: [
          "Review trust policies as carefully as permission policies.",
          "Avoid wildcard permissions unless the scope is justified and controlled.",
          "Test permission changes in a non-production environment.",
          "Create a documented process for access revocation and compromised credentials."
        ],
        failureModes: [
          "AccessDenied errors result from missing actions, resource scope or trust permissions.",
          "An incorrect role trust relationship prevents a workload from assuming its role.",
          "A leaked long-lived key creates a credential compromise risk.",
          "Key policy restrictions prevent expected encryption or decryption operations."
