          "Define service-level indicators for availability, latency and error rates.",
          "Create alarms for target health, compute saturation and database pressure.",
          "Centralize logs with retention, access control and useful correlation fields.",
          "Document recovery procedures and ownership for each critical dependency.",
          "Run restore and failover exercises and record measured recovery times."
        ],
        productionConsiderations: [
          "Set RTO and RPO from business requirements and validate them through exercises.",
          "Monitor application-level symptoms, not only EC2 CPU utilization.",
          "Ensure recovery credentials, network routes and DNS changes are available during incidents.",
          "Avoid assuming that a successful backup job proves that recovery will work."
