        "answer": "Amazon EC2 provides resizable compute instances. A production design combines instance selection, images, networking, storage, identity, scaling, patching, monitoring and recovery. It provides a defined way to organize the components and responsibilities involved. In a production environment, the design should be selected according to workload requirements, security boundaries, operational capability and measurable service objectives."
