          "Detect symptoms and determine the affected architecture boundary.",
          "Collect logs, metrics, traces and configuration evidence.",
          "Restore service safely and prevent recurrence."
        ],
        "practicalTask": "Route /api traffic to one target group and /shop traffic to another while maintaining independent health checks."
      }
    ],
    "summary": "An Application Load Balancer distributes HTTP and HTTPS requests across registered targets. Listener rules support host-based and path-based routing, TLS termination and health-based traffic distribution."
