        "question": "What problem does ECS solve?",
        "answer": "Amazon ECS orchestrates container workloads using clusters, task definitions, tasks and services. It integrates with load balancing, IAM, networking, image registries and deployment controls. It provides a defined way to organize the components and responsibilities involved. In a production environment, the design should be selected according to workload requirements, security boundaries, operational capability and measurable service objectives."
