        "answer": "The key risks include Crash loops, unschedulable pods, DNS failures, resource pressure, etcd issues and broken rollout configuration. Reduce them through explicit boundaries, least-privilege access, capacity planning, health monitoring, tested recovery procedures and controlled configuration changes. Verify the controls with practical failure tests."
