        "question": "How would you troubleshoot a failure in this architecture?",
        "answer": "Start from the reported symptom and identify the affected user or workload path. Trace kubectl or CI -> API Server -> Controllers and Scheduler -> Nodes and Pods -> Services and Ingress -> Persistent Storage. Check recent changes, component health, permissions, routing, dependency responses and telemetry. Change one variable at a time and confirm recovery with an end-to-end test."
      },
