        "question": "Give a practical implementation example.",
        "answer": "Deploy a three-replica API with readiness and liveness probes, service discovery and safe rolling updates. Implement the design in a non-production environment first, document its dependencies and security controls, test normal and failure paths, and promote it through a reviewed deployment process. Capture metrics and logs so the production team can operate it reliably."
