        "explanation": "Important failure patterns include: Crash loops, unschedulable pods, DNS failures, resource pressure, etcd issues and broken rollout configuration. Troubleshooting should start with the user-visible symptom and move through the architecture one boundary at a time. Check recent changes, component health, access decisions, routing, dependency status and telemetry. Validate the recovery with a real request or workload test, then document the root cause and preventive action.",
