      },
      {
        "question": "Give a practical implementation example.",
        "answer": "Create a role that installs and configures a web service across a controlled host group with validation and rollback steps. Implement the design in a non-production environment first, document its dependencies and security controls, test normal and failure paths, and promote it through a reviewed deployment process. Capture metrics and logs so the production team can operate it reliably."
      }
    ],
