    "interviewQuestions": [
      {
        "question": "What problem does CloudFormation solve?",
        "answer": "CloudFormation provisions AWS resources from declarative templates and manages them as stacks. Production use depends on change sets, stack policies, parameters, outputs and drift detection. It provides a defined way to organize the components and responsibilities involved. In a production environment, the design should be selected according to workload requirements, security boundaries, operational capability and measurable service objectives."
