        "question": "What are the most important production risks?",
        "answer": "The key risks include Timeouts, duplicate events, concurrency exhaustion, cold starts, permission errors and vendor-specific coupling. Reduce them through explicit boundaries, least-privilege access, capacity planning, health monitoring, tested recovery procedures and controlled configuration changes. Verify the controls with practical failure tests."
      },
      {
        "question": "How would you troubleshoot a failure in this architecture?",
